# Fill in your Firebase Project credentials below:
# 1. Go to https://console.firebase.google.com/
# 2. Select / Create your Project -> Project Settings (gear icon) -> General
# 3. Under "Your apps", select Web App (</>)
# 4. Copy the firebaseConfig keys and paste them below:

VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=AIzaSy...
